title: "Dynamic Functional Connectomics and Graph Neural Networks for ADHD Classification"
abstract: "Authoritative research artifact and source-of-truth code repository evaluating dynamic resting-state functional connectivity, multi-site ComBat harmonization, classical and quantum graph convolutional networks, spatio-temporal baselines, and leave-one-site-out population graph learning across the ADHD-200 consortium."
